"This week, a punter has to act as a marriage guidance councellor to a couple where the husband has the alter ego of superman."},{"s":10,"e":9,"t":"Episode 9","a":"1996-09-21","l":30,"d":"Includes a repeat of the infamous 'Close Encounters of the Beadle Kind' stunt."},{"s":10,"e":10,"t":"Episode 10","a":"1996-10-31","l":30,"d":"Jeremy Beadle continues to practice practical jokes and madcap windups on unsuspecting members of the public."}]}